This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
expresses FitSM-1 "Requirements" (version 3.0.1) as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline-compose.

FitSM is a lightweight IT service management standards family maintained by ITEMO e.V. (the
FitSM working group), and was co-funded by the European Commission under the Seventh
Framework Programme (contract number 312851). All parts of FitSM are published under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), which permits reproduction and derivation
with attribution. The requirement text restated here is derived from FitSM-1; each item's
attrs.source_ref cites the relevant requirement. ITEMO does not endorse this repository. The
authoritative documents are available from the FitSM working group at https://www.fitsm.eu.
